<section class="hero-line role-hero role-hero-system"><div><span class="eyebrow">TIZIM BOSHQARUVI</span><h1>Tizim xodimi paneli</h1><p>Magistrantlar, nazorat ma’lumotlari, fayllar, foydalanuvchi profillari, dars jadvali va ma’lumotlar sifatini boshqaring. Yuqori vakolatli hisoblarning maxfiy ma’lumotlari alohida himoyalanadi.</p></div><div class="hero-actions"><a class="secondary" href="/control">Tizim nazorati</a><a class="secondary" href="/timetable/import">▦ Excel jadval yuklash</a><a class="primary" href="/students/quick">⚡ Tezkor kiritish</a></div></section>
